flowchart TD
    A[Authenticated requester] --> B[Help & Support]
    B --> C[Create ticket]
    C --> D[Submit ticket]
    D --> E[Ticket created: NEW]
    E --> F[Support queue]
    F --> G[Assigned]
    G --> H[In Progress]
    H --> I{Need customer information?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Waiting for Customer]
    J --> K[Requester provides information]
    K --> H
    I -- No --> L[Resolve ticket]
    L --> M[Resolved]
    M --> N{Requester requests reopening?}
    N -- No --> O[Closed]
    N -- Yes --> P[Support reviews request]
    P --> Q{Approved?}
    Q -- Yes --> H
    Q -- No --> M
    O --> R[New ticket required if further support is needed]
    S[Support Agent] --> F
    T[Support Manager] --> F
    U[Administrator] --> F
    V[Customer / Seller / Driver] --> B
